WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:21.357
Lady Yoo was scowling when her maid brought tea.

2
00:00:21.377 --> 00:00:25.320
"My husband loves Gildong too much!"

3
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.061
she said angrily.

4
00:00:27.081 --> 00:00:32.233
"He should love Inhyun more—not some lowborn boy."

5
00:00:33.713 --> 00:00:34.653
The maid nodded.

6
00:00:34.673 --> 00:00:41.635
"My lady, perhaps you need to get rid of Gildong."

7
00:00:43.296 --> 00:00:44.496
Lady Yoo sighed.

8
00:00:44.516 --> 00:00:50.978
"I tried, but my husband sent only Mongdol away."

9
00:00:50.998 --> 00:00:57.460
"Well, there are other ways," the maid said.

10
00:00:58.416 --> 00:01:00.638
"But they are not cheap."

11
00:01:02.019 --> 00:01:02.920
"I'll do anything.

12
00:01:03.841 --> 00:01:06.503
I just want him gone," Lady Yoo said.

13
00:01:06.523 --> 00:01:09.425
"Of course, my lady."

14
00:01:10.506 --> 00:01:11.887
The maid smiled.

15
00:01:11.907 --> 00:01:15.450
"I know someone who could help."

16
00:01:19.953 --> 00:01:23.656
A few days later, Lady Yoo was walking with Lord Hong.

17
00:01:25.598 --> 00:01:27.840
Her maid approached with a strange woman.

18
00:01:30.128 --> 00:01:32.170
"My lord, my lady.

19
00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:36.573
This visitor is here to speak to you," the maid said.

20
00:01:36.593 --> 00:01:38.734
"Who are you?"

21
00:01:39.275 --> 00:01:40.295
Lord Hong asked.

22
00:01:41.436 --> 00:01:42.717
The woman smiled.

23
00:01:42.737 --> 00:01:44.998
"My name is Choonja.

24
00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.020
I am a face-reader.

25
00:01:47.921 --> 00:01:50.983
I can also tell a person's future by looking at their face.

26
00:01:52.023 --> 00:01:54.925
I am here to offer my services to Your Lordship."

27
00:01:56.847 --> 00:01:58.288
Lord Hong grumbled.

28
00:01:59.276 --> 00:02:01.298
"I don't believe in such things."

29
00:02:01.318 --> 00:02:05.641
"Husband, why not let her try?"

30
00:02:06.141 --> 00:02:07.142
Lady Yoo said.

31
00:02:07.162 --> 00:02:11.505
"Fine," Lord Hong said.

32
00:02:16.209 --> 00:02:18.450
Choonja stared at Lord Hong.

33
00:02:23.474 --> 00:02:25.656
Lordship has a most noble face.

34
00:02:26.668 --> 00:02:29.110
You will serve the kingdom for many years."

35
00:02:34.473 --> 00:02:37.074
She closed her eyes and waved her hands.

36
00:02:37.094 --> 00:02:43.818
"I sense an energy from the side of your body bamboo?"

37
00:02:43.858 --> 00:02:45.740
Lord Hong blinked in surprise.

38
00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:49.082
"I have a scar shaped like bamboo on my side.

39
00:02:50.082 --> 00:02:50.963
How did you know that?

40
00:02:51.723 --> 00:02:52.924
Only my wife knows of it!"

41
00:02:54.416 --> 00:02:56.417
Lady Yoo smiled at Choonja.

42
00:02:57.457 --> 00:02:59.978
"You are very talented.

43
00:03:01.058 --> 00:03:04.539
Please tell us what you see in our son's face."

44
00:03:04.559 --> 00:03:10.800
"Yes, and please read Gildong's face as well," Lord Hong said.

45
00:03:13.441 --> 00:03:14.821
Inhyun came out first.

46
00:03:20.283 --> 00:03:24.004
boy is kind and smart," the face-reader said.

47
00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.921
"He will be an important man, just like his father."

48
00:03:30.782 --> 00:03:32.302
Gildong came out next.

49
00:03:36.443 --> 00:03:37.584
asked to see me, Your Lordship?"

50
00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:38.444
he said.

51
00:03:42.205 --> 00:03:45.566
Choonja turned pale and backed away from the boy.

52
00:03:47.887 --> 00:03:49.227
Lord Hong looked worried.

53
00:03:51.007 --> 00:03:52.568
He sent both boys away.

54
00:03:57.336 --> 00:03:58.117
"What did you see?"

55
00:03:58.557 --> 00:03:59.658
he asked Choonja.

56
00:03:59.678 --> 00:04:06.002
"I cannot say it out loud, my lord," Choonja said.

57
00:04:06.022 --> 00:04:08.624
"I command you to speak!"

58
00:04:09.004 --> 00:04:09.965
Lord Hong said.

59
00:04:11.286 --> 00:04:13.908
Choonja crawled closer to Lord Hong.

60
00:04:13.928 --> 00:04:18.151
"There is danger in the boy," she said quietly.

61
00:04:18.171 --> 00:04:20.853
"What danger?

62
00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:24.756
Please tell us," Lady Yoo said.

63
00:04:26.952 --> 00:04:28.734
"That boy will become a king!"

64
00:04:32.838 --> 00:04:33.759
Lord Hong said.

65
00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.502
Lady Yoo grabbed his arm.

66
00:04:36.522 --> 00:04:39.325
"Gildong is lowborn.

67
00:04:40.566 --> 00:04:45.811
To become a king he must commit evil deeds!"
